    ],
    "text": "PROVINCIAL COUNCILS ELECTIONS ACT, No. 2 OF 1988",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-BoldMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      129.57,
      348.49,
      458.16,
      359.56
    ],
    "text": "Filling of a Vacancy in the North Western Province Provincial Council",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-BoldMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      47.85,
      385.09,
      539.91,
      420.16
    ],
    "text": "WHEREAS the Secretary of the North Western Province Provincial Council has informed me under Section 65(1) of theProvincial Councils Elections Act, No. 2 of 1988 that a vacancy has occurred in the membership of the North WesternProvince Provincial Council by reason of Appointing the Member of Parliament ;",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      47.85,
      433.09,
      539.85,
      468.16
    ],
    "text": "And whereas the Secretary of the United People's Freedom Alliance, the recognized political party to which themember belonged was required by me under Section 65(2) of the aforesaid Act, to nominate an eligible person to fill suchvacancy ;",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      47.85,
      481.09,
      539.89,
      504.16
    ],
    "text": "And whereas the Secretary of the aforesaid recognized political party has nominated Mr. A. A. Nimal Karunathilaketo fill such vacancy ;",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      47.85,
      517.09,
      539.89,
      552.16
    ],
    "text": "I, Waduge Warunasiri Mahinda Deshapriya, Commissioner of Elections, acting in terms of Section 65(2) of theProvincial Councils Elections Act, No. 2 of 1988, do hereby declare Mr. A. A. Nimal Karunathilake, elected as a member of theabove Provincial Council from the Administrative District of Kurunagala in respect of which such vacancy occurred.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      425.85,
      589.09,
      533.86,
      612.16
    ],
    "text": "MAHINDA DESHAPRIYA,Commissioner of Elections.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      7.0,
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      47.85,
      637.09,
      131.16,
      672.16
    ],
    "text": "Elections Secretariat,Rajagiriya.26th May, 2015.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
